    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.65pt 0.5pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0.25pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 6%; border: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><B>No.</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 54%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">RESOLUTIONS</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 7%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">FOR<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">AGAINST<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">ABSTAIN<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; border-left: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">2.</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">To approve a reverse stock split (the &ldquo;Reverse
    Split&rdquo;) of the Company&rsquo;s issued ordinary shares at a ratio of not less than one (1)-for-three hundred sixty (360) and</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">not more than one (1)-for-seven hundred twenty
    (720), with the exact ratio to be set at a whole number within this range to be determined by the Company&rsquo;s Board,</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">or any duly constituted committee thereof, in
    its discretion.</P></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: Black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">1.If any proxy other than the Chief Executive
Officer of the Company is preferred, strike out the words &ldquo;<B><I>the Chief Executive Officer of the Company or&rdquo;</I></B> and
insert the name and address of the proxy desired in the space provided. A member may appoint one or more proxies to attend and vote in
his stead. <B>Any alteration made to this form of proxy must be initialed by the person(s) who sign(s) it.</B></P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT>
<B>IMPORTANT: If you wish to vote for the resolution, tick the box marked &ldquo;FOR&rdquo;. If you wish to vote against the resolution,
tick the box marked &ldquo;AGAINST&rdquo;. If you wish to abstain from voting on the resolution, tick the box marked &ldquo;ABSTAIN&rdquo;.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 6%; border: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><B>No.</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 54%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">RESOLUTIONS</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 7%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">FOR<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">AGAINST<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 6.5pt 0.5pt 6.5pt 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">ABSTAIN<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-top: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; border-left: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">3.</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Subject to the Shareholders&rsquo; approval of
    Proposal Two and the Board&rsquo;s implementation of the Reverse Split, to suspend the trading of the Company&rsquo;s American</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Depositary Receipts / Shares (&ldquo;ADRs&rdquo;),
    terminate the deposit agreement for the ADRs among the Company, its depositary bank, Citibank, N.A. (the &ldquo;Depositary&rdquo;),</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">and the holders and beneficial owners of the Company&rsquo;s
    ADRs, the exchange of ADRs for the corresponding ordinary shares of the Company and commence trading of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares
    on the Nasdaq Stock Market upon the effectiveness of the Reverse Split.</P></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding: 0.25pt 5.9pt 0.5pt 5.65pt; border-right: black 1pt solid">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; border-right: black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>2</SUP></FONT>
<B>IMPORTANT: If you wish to vote for the resolution, tick the box marked &ldquo;FOR&rdquo;. If you wish to vote against the resolution,
tick the box marked &ldquo;AGAINST&rdquo;. If you wish to abstain from voting on the resolution, tick the box marked &ldquo;ABSTAIN&rdquo;.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

