<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><SUP>3</SUP></FONT>
This form of proxy must be signed by you or your attorney duly authorized in writing or, in the case of a corporation, must be either
executed under its common seal or under the hand of an officer or attorney duly authorized to sign the same.</P>



